## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Frontend - New Public Attendance Page

#### [NEW] [QrAttendance.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Projects/escloop%20gym%20github%202/escloop/client/src/pages/QrAttendance.jsx)

A **minimal, mobile-first** page without sidebar/header that:
- Shows gym branding at top
- Has a large Member ID input field
- "Mark Attendance" button
- Uses localStorage to remember last used Member ID
- If localStorage has saved ID → pre-fill and optionally auto-submit
- Shows success/error messages with colored feedback
- Audio feedback (reuses existing `/audio/` files)
- No login required

**Key Features:**
```javascript
// Pseudo-code structure
const QrAttendance = () => {
  const [memberId, setMemberId] = useState(localStorage.getItem('qr_member_id') || '');
  const [status, setStatus] = useState(null); // success | error | loading
  
  // Auto-submit if returning user
  useEffect(() => {
    if (localStorage.getItem('qr_member_id')) {
      // Optional: auto-submit on load
    }
  }, []);
  
  const handleSubmit = async () => {
    // Save to localStorage for next time
    localStorage.setItem('qr_member_id', memberId);
    
    // Call PUBLIC attendance API (no auth)
    const res = await fetch('/gym/public-check', {
      method: 'POST',
      body: JSON.stringify({ attendanceId: memberId })
    });
    
    // Handle response + play audio
  };
}
```

